  "content": "<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/refined-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#f00;text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\">此模組需要精緻儲存（Refined Storage）</span></span></span></span></strong></span></a></h2><p>如果你想將此模組加入你的模組包，歡迎自由使用 :)<br><br></p><p>此模組新增了一個跨維度無線傳輸器，可在所有維度間無距離限制地傳輸。<br>如同精緻儲存中的其他方塊，它也有多種顏色變體。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/345/509/310/172/creative_wireless_transmitter.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"310\" height=\"155\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/WpUmcmUayN\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.cloudflare.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/40115388/ec29dadf15db1421b9984cc1234b28314f448a34.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"381\" height=\"144\"></a></p>",
